<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 250 mln guilder bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 250 mln guilder bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    10.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    10.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    100.100   SPREAD	+48 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.50 PCT JUNE 2006 DSL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
